 ('Briefing room',[('Analyst','Trust in local government rose four points.','A confiança no governo local subiu quatro pontos.'),('Reporter','Albeit modestly. And the press?','Embora modestamente. E a imprensa?'),('Analyst','Still below half, be that as it may.','Ainda abaixo da metade, seja como for.'),('Reporter','So officials played down the decline.','Então as autoridades minimizaram o declínio.')]),
 [('Make a concession with albeit.','Conceda.','The plan is sound, albeit expensive.'),('Use much as.','Use.','Much as I admire her, I cannot agree.'),('Use however + adjective.','Use.','However tired you are, finish the report.')],
